~ start
Lisa Stone: Ahoy there Cap'n! [ID:lisa 1.1]
You: Ahoy! Lisa, do you know anything about a possible mutiny in the crew?[ID:you 1.6]
Lisa Stone: Yes, I do. Awhile ago me and Marley both realized something odd was going on with the crew mates. We started working together to figure it out, but I knew better than to trust that scallywag. Never believe anything he be sayin'. He be the type of scum that lies just for the kick of it. But I'll give it to you straight Cap'n. Charles be the leader of the mutiny. [ID:lisa 1.2]
- Charles? The Butler?
	You: Charles? The Butler? [ID:you 1.7.1]
	Lisa Stone: Aye. Charles may act polite, but really he be as greedy as one can be. He left the rich family he worked for after WE robbed them. And now he be stealin' your gold and using it to buy support with the other crew mates. [ID:lisa 1.3]
- Are you sure it's not Marley?
	You: Are you sure it's not Marley? [ID:you 1.7.2]
	Lisa Stone: Aye. Marley may be a liar, but as far as I can tell he's got nothin' to do with the mutiny. Whenever Charles cleans your quarters, he steals gold and uses it to bribe crew mates into following him. You know how he be with money. He left the rich family he worked for after WE robbed them. He might act polite, but he'd do anything for gold. [ID:lisa 1.3.2]
=> END